# Reverse-proxies the Signal IQ dashboard behind automatic HTTPS (Caddy
# obtains and renews a Let's Encrypt certificate on its own — no manual
# cert management). Fronts dashboard_server.py, which keeps listening on
# plain HTTP at 127.0.0.1:8080 unchanged; only Caddy is exposed externally.
#
# Domain: a zero-config sslip.io hostname that resolves directly to the
# droplet's IP (159-65-19-136.sslip.io -> 159.65.19.136), so this works
# with no DNS setup. Swap for a real domain later by changing this one
# line and pointing its A record at the droplet — everything else here
# stays the same.
159-65-19-136.sslip.io {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
